<template>
    <heading>Table of Contents</heading>
    <keywords><li>view</li><li>navigation</li><li>table of contents</li></keywords>
    <section data-lp5-kind="explanation">
        <p>The TOC and Source Pane describe the same model records. Filenames connect their elements because titles may be absent or repeated; maps avoid turning filenames into CSS selectors. Model document order and parent filenames determine the nested lists without inventing another hierarchy.</p>
        <p>Collapse state belongs to View and survives reloads of the selected storage object. A new model selection ID clears it, including when two projects have identical filenames. Selecting an entry highlights its source article and scrolls only the Source Pane; changing a disclosure control does not select an article. Selection is driven by clicks and resets on load, rather than following manual scrolling.</p>
    </section>
    <section data-lp5-kind="code">
        <name>View table of contents</name>
        <code><![CDATA[let displayedSelectionId;
const collapsedArticles = new Set();
let articleElements = new Map();
let tocEntries = new Map();
let selectedFilename = null;

function selectArticle(filename) {
    if (selectedFilename !== null) {
        articleElements.get(selectedFilename)?.classList.remove("LP5-Selected");
        tocEntries.get(selectedFilename)?.removeAttribute("aria-current");
    }
    selectedFilename = filename;
    const article = articleElements.get(filename);
    article.classList.add("LP5-Selected");
    tocEntries.get(filename).setAttribute("aria-current", "true");
    const pane = document.getElementById("LP5-Source");
    pane.scrollTop += article.getBoundingClientRect().top -
        pane.getBoundingClientRect().top - pane.clientTop;
}

function renderTableOfContents(articles) {
    const children = new Map();
    for (const article of articles) {
        if (!children.has(article.parentFilename))
            children.set(article.parentFilename, []);
        children.get(article.parentFilename).push(article);
    }
    const entries = new Map();
    function list(parentFilename) {
        const ul = document.createElement("ul");
        for (const article of children.get(parentFilename) || []) {
            const li = document.createElement("li");
            li.dataset.lp5Filename = article.filename;
            const row = document.createElement("div");
            row.className = "LP5-TocRow";
            const button = document.createElement("button");
            button.type = "button";
            const heading = Array.from(article.document.documentElement.children)
                .find(element => element.tagName === "heading");
            const title = heading?.textContent.trim() || article.filename;
            button.textContent = title;
            button.title = article.filename;
            button.className = "LP5-TocEntry";
            button.addEventListener("click", () => selectArticle(article.filename));
            entries.set(article.filename, button);
            li.append(row);
            if (children.has(article.filename)) {
                const nested = list(article.filename);
                const toggle = document.createElement("button");
                toggle.type = "button";
                toggle.className = "LP5-TocToggle";
                function showExpansion() {
                    const open = !collapsedArticles.has(article.filename);
                    nested.hidden = !open;
                    toggle.textContent = open ? "▾" : "▸";
                    toggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(open));
                    toggle.setAttribute("aria-label", (open ? "Collapse " : "Expand ") + title);
                }
                toggle.addEventListener("click", () => {
                    if (collapsedArticles.has(article.filename))
                        collapsedArticles.delete(article.filename);
                    else
                        collapsedArticles.add(article.filename);
                    showExpansion();
                });
                showExpansion();
                row.append(toggle, button);
                li.append(nested);
            } else {
                const spacer = document.createElement("span");
                spacer.className = "LP5-TocSpacer";
                spacer.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
                row.append(spacer, button);
            }
            ul.append(li);
        }
        return ul;
    }
    return { content: list(null), entries };
}
]]></code>
    </section>
</template>
